.TH AVR\-FEEDBACK\-STATUS 1 "" "avr 0.7.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-feedback-status \- Read the delivery status of your feedback.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr feedback status
[OPTIONS] FEEDBACK_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the delivery status of your feedback.
.PP
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIFEEDBACK_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-jq\fR, \fB\-q\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter JSON with an embedded jq expression.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output comma-separated fields, * for all, or ? to list fields.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-feedback (1)
